# 小屏, a finger: words sent in a chat whose agent's turn is over, flying from the composer into their bubble; the
# station has them, its agent sets to work and answers (chat_fixture.mbt's pace). What each frame of the flight costs,
# and of what follows it till the answer is in.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 看一下列表的高度
wait 700
log measure
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 5500
exit
